                "message":  "Add MLOps placeholder and repository change workflows\n\nAdd mlops_2026 as an MLOps course placeholder with its course link and\nowner-local specification. Add FastAPI and uvicorn[standard], keep shared\nPython settings at root, and move dependency metadata and the lock to tools/py.\n\nRegister repo-python under tools/py with mandatory type hints, and keep the\nrepo-openspec integration skill under tools/openspec, routing generic workflow\nsteps to the pinned upstream skills. Require review-agent\nfor all change reviews, pinned to an immutable OpenAI Codex source archive with\nintegrity and licensing. Generate its unchanged instructions and invocation\nmetadata through Bazel skill discovery; remove the local review substitute.\n\nRequire OpenSpec for every repository change in AGENTS.md and apply that policy\nthrough repo-workspace and openspec. Add and archive owner-local records for\nthis PR, identifying their retrospective creation and validation limits.\n\nValidation: repository quality, dependency and Gazelle consistency, Python\nchecker consumers, skill discovery and eval configuration, OpenSpec current\nand archived specifications, documentation builds, and affected semantic lint.\n\nOpenSpec-Change: infra/src/openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-04-organize-python-course-development\n\nLLM-disclaimer: This commit was generated by an LLM.\n"
